              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
You missed the point on the magic marker (this is one of the things
I like about nethack).  ;^)

Obviously this is not a "Magic Marker"(TM), it is a marker that is,
literally, *magic*.  If you wrote something on a scroll with a normal
pen (quill-pen) then reading the scroll wouldn't accomplish anything.
It's the magic in the marker that makes the difference.

For example: what happens when the marker you use to write on blank
             scrolls is blessed?

Most of the technology included in nethack has a humorous effect or
is a joke in and of itself.  It is never gratuitous, which is what I
think a time-portal into the future would be.

I think there should be a photo-processing shop in the mall.  You have
to buy film there before your camera can take pictures.  Why?
Well, I was thinking, wouldn't it be nice to have a picture of medusa
in your pocket?  You could show it to all your enemies!  ;^).  Of
course they could always refuse to look at it, but it could have a chance
of stoning them (or you too, so be careful - don't do an inventory with
this item in your pack unless you are blind!).

